00:05:28.661 --> 00:05:30.630
♪ Tastes like Juicy Fruit ♪

00:05:30.630 --> 00:05:33.933
♪ Works like a ♪

00:05:33.933 --> 00:05:36.869
♪ We don't, we don't,
we don't, we don't, we don't ♪

00:05:36.869 --> 00:05:39.438
♪ Don't you color out ♪

00:05:39.438 --> 00:05:42.041
♪ Don't you bleed on out ♪

00:05:42.041 --> 00:05:45.744
♪ Stay in the line, stay in ♪

00:05:45.744 --> 00:05:48.714
♪ Dandelion ♪

00:05:48.714 --> 00:05:57.690 line:0%
♪♪

00:05:57.690 --> 00:05:59.191
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:59.191 --> 00:06:01.393
-That's gonna be fun to see that
in the theater.

00:06:01.393 --> 00:06:03.061
Play it loud.
-Something new.

00:06:03.061 --> 00:06:04.864
-That's gonna be cool.
Chance the Rapper, everybody.

